## VERDICT

**SIDE_HUSTLE_WITH_STAIRCASE** (confidence: 0.68)

No single $0-500 model reliably reaches $10K/mo NET in 12 months — that's P95+ territory. A PORTFOLIO of 2-3 code-leverage models (calculator + directory + monitoring) operated by a dev founder from Vietnam can realistically reach $3-8K/mo in 12 months and staircase to $10K+ in 18-24 months.

**The staircase:** Month 1-3 calculator suite (Model 5) → Month 4-6 directory for same niche (Model 3) → Month 7-9 monitoring for same audience (Model 11) → Month 10-12 portfolio $3-8K/mo → Month 13-18 micro-acquire competitors (Model 7) → Month 18-24 mountain territory.

**Key insight:** At $0-500, the product IS founder's time × coding skill × niche selection accuracy. Capital constraint forces CODE LEVERAGE as only viable type. This is an ADVANTAGE — filters out capital-heavy competitors, selects for the exact skill this founder has.

